# ==============================================================================
# Turbase Presentation Suite — .gitignore
# ==============================================================================

# --- API Keys & Credentials ---
text_to_speech_mcp_Open_API_key.txt
*.key
*.pem
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- Generated Binary Artifacts (Deterministic Pipeline Outputs) ---
# Audio (Tracked in Git as pre-synthesized master assets)
*.wav
*.aac
*.ogg

# Video (Deterministic FFmpeg render targets — excluded from git)
*.mp4
*.webm
*.mov
*.mkv

# Documents & PDFs & Generated Web Decks
*.pdf
**/web_deck/index.html
**/generated/outputs/web_deck/index.html
**/generated/outputs/pdf/*.pdf
**/generated/outputs/video/*.mp4

# Captured Slide Screenshots (generated from HTML web decks)
**/slides_png/*.png
**/slides_png/*.jpg
**/slides_png/*.jpeg
**/slides_png/*.webp
**/generated/artifacts/slides_png/*.png

# Preserve documentation inside artifact directories
!**/slides_png/AGENTS.md
!**/audio/AGENTS.md
!**/docs/AGENTS.md
!**/video_exports/AGENTS.md
!**/generated/**/AGENTS.md

# --- Temporary & Build Directories & Build Caches ---
**/.build_cache.json
**/generated/.build_cache.json
**/temp_audio_segments/
**/temp_video/
**/generated/artifacts/temp*/
**/individual_slide_pdfs/
**/video_exports/
**/*_preview.html
**/concat_*.txt

# --- OpenShot Video Editor Project Assets ---
Video Project_assets/
Video Project_parts_assets/

# --- Node & Environment Artifacts ---
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# --- Operating System Artifacts ---
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
